## ncurses is zero relative but the agui library is one relative.
## The agui library will adjust the row and col
## row col width height color dir style text
## color       - (0-7) RED, GREEN, YELLOW, BLUE, MAGENTA, CYAN, WHITE
## dir         - Direction Vertical=V, Horizontal=H or Unused=U
## style       - Double=D or single=S line graphics
## All blank lines need to start with ##
##
#@B   0   0  81   3   7 U D 'null'
#@B  17   0  81   3   7 U S 'null'
#@L   8   1  79   0   7 H D 'null'
#@T   1  17   0   0   4 U U 'NETWORK MONITOR - REAL-TIME STATISTICS VIEWER'
#@T   3   1   0   0   4 U U 'Monitor Status:'
#@T   4   1   0   0   4 U U 'Last Update:'
#@T   7   2   0   0   2 U U 'PACKET STATISTIC'
#@T   9   2   0   0   4 U U 'Total Packets:'
#@T  10   2   0   0   4 U U 'TCP Packets:'
#@T  11   2   0   0   4 U U 'UDP Packets:'
#@T  12   2   0   0   4 U U 'ICMP Packets:'
#@T  13   2   0   0   4 U U 'SYN Packets:'
#@T  14   2   0   0   1 U U 'Suspicious Events:'
#@T  15   2   0   0   4 U U 'Unique Protocols:'
#@T  18   2   0   0   2 U U 'TOP PROTOCOLS (by packet count)'
